abstract: >
  Runnable tutorials for PanGBank, a web-based platform for exploring,
  analyzing, and downloading precomputed microbial pangenomes built with
  PPanGGOLiN. The repository contains end-to-end and focused tutorials
  covering analyses such as antimicrobial resistance gene distribution,
  Regions of Genome Plasticity, Spots, and genome projection.

